This is a complete offline HTML document that builds a reference-photo fidelity review board for your browser, with pasteable brief fields, score tiles, constraint notes, and a copyable handoff report.

html
<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Reference Fidelity Review Board</title>

    <style>

        :root {

            --bg: #0f0f1a;

            --surface: #1a1a2e;

            --surface-2: #21213a;

            --surface-3: #282845;

            --border: #2a2a45;

            --text: #e0e0e8;

            --text-secondary: #a0a0b8;

            --text-muted: #6b6b80;

            --accent: #4fc3f7;

            --accent-glow: rgba(79, 195, 247, 0.25);

            --red: #ef5350;

            --orange: #ff9800;

            --yellow: #ffc107;

            --lime: #aed581;

            --green: #4caf50;

            --red-bg: rgba(239, 83, 80, 0.12);

            --orange-bg: rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.12);

            --yellow-bg: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.12);

            --lime-bg: rgba(174, 213, 129, 0.12);

            --green-bg: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.12);

            --radius-sm: 8px;

            --radius: 12px;

            --radius-lg: 16px;

            --shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);

            --shadow-lg: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);

            --transition: 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);

            --font: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;

            --font-mono: 'SF Mono', 'Cascadia Code', 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;

        }



        * {

            margin: 0;

            padding: 0;

            box-sizing: border-box;

        }



        html {

            font-size: 15px;

            scroll-behavior: smooth;

        }



        body {

            font-family: var(--font);

            background: var(--bg);

            color: var(--text);

            min-height: 100vh;

            line-height: 1.5;

            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;

            background-image:

                radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 10%, rgba(79, 195, 247, 0.04) 0%, transparent 60%),

                radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 90%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04) 0%, transparent 60%);

        }



        /* ── HEADER ──────────────────────── */

        .header {

            background: var(--surface);

            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);

            padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: space-between;

            gap: 1rem;

            flex-wrap: wrap;

            position: sticky;

            top: 0;

            z-index: 50;

            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);

            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);

            box-shadow: 0 1px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);

        }

        .header-brand {

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 0.6rem;

            font-weight: 700;

            font-size: 1.2rem;

            letter-spacing: -0.01em;

            color: #fff;

        }

        .header-brand .icon {

            width: 36px;

            height: 36px;

            border-radius: 10px;

            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #7c4dff);

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            font-size: 1.2rem;

            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px var(--accent-glow);

        }

        .header-actions {

            display: flex;

            gap: 0.5rem;

            flex-wrap: wrap;

            align-items: center;

        }

        .btn {

            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;

            border-radius: 8px;

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            background: var(--surface-3);

            color: var(--text);

            cursor: pointer;

            font-size: 0.85rem;

            font-weight: 500;

            transition: var(--transition);

            white-space: nowrap;

            font-family: var(--font);

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 0.4rem;

            user-select: none;

        }

        .btn:hover {

            background: var(--surface-2);

            border-color: #4a4a6a;

            transform: translateY(-1px);

        }

        .btn:active {

            transform: scale(0.97);

            transition: 0.08s;

        }

        .btn.primary {

            background: var(--accent);

            color: #0a0a18;

            border-color: var(--accent);

            font-weight: 600;

            box-shadow: 0 4px 18px var(--accent-glow);

        }

        .btn.primary:hover {

            background: #5ecbf7;

            box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(79, 195, 247, 0.35);

        }

        .btn.ghost {

            background: transparent;

            border-color: transparent;

            color: var(--text-secondary);

        }

        .btn.ghost:hover {

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);

            border-color: transparent;

            color: var(--text);

        }

        .btn.danger-ghost {

            background: transparent;

            border-color: transparent;

            color: #ef5350;

            opacity: 0.7;

        }

        .btn.danger-ghost:hover {

            opacity: 1;

            background: rgba(239, 83, 80, 0.08);

        }

        .save-indicator {

            font-size: 0.75rem;

            color: var(--text-muted);

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 0.35rem;

            padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem;

            border-radius: 20px;

            background: var(--surface-2);

            transition: var(--transition);

        }

        .save-indicator.saved {

            color: #aed581;

        }

        .save-dot {

            width: 7px;

            height: 7px;

            border-radius: 50%;

            background: currentColor;

            transition: var(--transition);

        }



        /* ── MAIN LAYOUT ────────────────── */

        .main-container {

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;

            gap: 1.25rem;

            padding: 1.25rem;

            max-width: 1500px;

            margin: 0 auto;

        }

        @media (max-width: 1100px) {

            .main-container {

                grid-template-columns: 1fr;

                max-width: 700px;

            }

        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {

            .main-container {

                padding: 0.75rem;

                gap: 0.75rem;

            }

            .header {

                padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem;

            }

            .header-brand {

                font-size: 1rem;

            }

            .btn {

                padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem;

                font-size: 0.78rem;

            }

        }



        /* ── PANELS ─────────────────────── */

        .panel {

            display: flex;

            flex-direction: column;

            gap: 1rem;

        }

        .card {

            background: var(--surface);

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);

            padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem;

            box-shadow: var(--shadow);

            transition: var(--transition);

        }

        .card:hover {

            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);

        }

        .card-header {

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 0.5rem;

            margin-bottom: 0.85rem;

            font-weight: 600;

            font-size: 0.9rem;

            letter-spacing: 0.02em;

            color: var(--text-secondary);

            text-transform: uppercase;

        }

        .card-header .dot {

            width: 9px;

            height: 9px;

            border-radius: 50%;

            flex-shrink: 0;

        }

        .card-header .dot.accent {

            background: var(--accent);

            box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-glow);

        }

        .card-header .dot.purple {

            background: #b388ff;

            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(179, 136, 255, 0.3);

        }

        .card-header .dot.pink {

            background: #f48fb1;

            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(244, 143, 177, 0.3);

        }



        textarea,

        input[type="text"] {

            width: 100%;

            background: var(--surface-2);

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            border-radius: var(--radius);

            padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;

            color: var(--text);

            font-family: var(--font);

            font-size: 0.9rem;

            resize: vertical;

            transition: var(--transition);

            line-height: 1.5;

        }

        textarea:focus,

        input[type="text"]:focus {

            outline: none;

            border-color: var(--accent);

            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79, 195, 247, 0.08);

            background: #1e1e38;

        }

        textarea::placeholder,

        input[type="text"]::placeholder {

            color: var(--text-muted);

            opacity: 0.6;

        }

        textarea {

            min-height: 90px;

        }

        textarea.tall {

            min-height: 130px;

        }

        textarea.short {

            min-height: 60px;

        }

        label {

            font-size: 0.8rem;

            font-weight: 600;

            color: var(--text-secondary);

            margin-bottom: 0.35rem;

            display: block;

            letter-spacing: 0.02em;

        }



        /* ── SCORE TILES ────────────────── */

        .score-tiles {

            display: flex;

            flex-direction: column;

            gap: 0.7rem;

        }

        .score-tile {

            background: var(--surface);

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            border-radius: var(--radius);

            padding: 1rem 1.15rem;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 1rem;

            transition: var(--transition);

            cursor: default;

            position: relative;

            overflow: hidden;

        }

        .score-tile::before {

            content: '';

            position: absolute;

            left: 0;

            top: 0;

            bottom: 0;

            width: 4px;

            border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0;

            transition: var(--transition);

        }

        .score-tile.score-0::before {

            background: var(--border);

        }

        .score-tile.score-1::before {

            background: var(--red);

            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(239, 83, 80, 0.4);

        }

        .score-tile.score-2::before {

            background: var(--orange);

            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.4);

        }

        .score-tile.score-3::before {

            background: var(--yellow);

            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.4);

        }

        .score-tile.score-4::before {

            background: var(--lime);

            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(174, 213, 129, 0.4);

        }

        .score-tile.score-5::before {

            background: var(--green);

            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.4);

        }

        .score-tile-info {

            flex: 1;

            min-width: 0;

        }

        .score-tile-label {

            font-weight: 700;

            font-size: 0.9rem;

            letter-spacing: 0.01em;

            color: #fff;

        }

        .score-tile-sub {

            font-size: 0.72rem;

            color: var(--text-muted);

            margin-top: 0.15rem;

        }

        .score-dots {

            display: flex;

            gap: 0.45rem;

            flex-shrink: 0;

        }

        .score-dot {

            width: 28px;

            height: 28px;

            border-radius: 50%;

            border: 2px solid var(--border);

            background: var(--surface-2);

            cursor: pointer;

            transition: var(--transition);

            position: relative;

            flex-shrink: 0;

        }

        .score-dot:hover {

            border-color: #6a6a8a;

            transform: scale(1.1);

        }

        .score-dot:active {

            transform: scale(0.9);

            transition: 0.06s;

        }

        .score-dot.active {

            border-color: transparent;

            transform: scale(1.05);

        }

        .score-dot.active.lvl-1 {

            background: var(--red);

            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(239, 83, 80, 0.5);

        }

        .score-dot.active.lvl-2 {

            background: var(--orange);

            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.5);

        }

        .score-dot.active.lvl-3 {

            background: var(--yellow);

            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.5);

        }

        .score-dot.active.lvl-4 {

            background: var(--lime);

            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(174, 213, 129, 0.5);

        }

        .score-dot.active.lvl-5 {

            background: var(--green);

            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.5);

        }

        .score-value-badge {

            font-weight: 800;

            font-size: 1.3rem;

            min-width: 38px;

            text-align: center;

            color: #fff;

            flex-shrink: 0;

        }

        .score-tile-note {

            width: 100%;

            margin-top: 0.5rem;

        }

        .score-tile-note input {

            font-size: 0.78rem;

            padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;

            border-radius: 6px;

            min-width: 0;

        }



        /* ── CONSTRAINT NOTES ───────────── */

        .constraint-grid {

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;

            gap: 0.75rem;

        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {

            .constraint-grid {

                grid-template-columns: 1fr;

            }

        }



        /* ── CHECKLIST ──────────────────── */

        .checklist {

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;

            gap: 0.4rem 1rem;

        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .checklist {

                grid-template-columns: 1fr;

            }

        }

        .checklist-item {

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 0.55rem;

            padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;

            border-radius: 8px;

            cursor: pointer;

            transition: var(--transition);

            user-select: none;

            background: var(--surface-2);

            border: 1px solid transparent;

        }

        .checklist-item:hover {

            background: var(--surface-3);

            border-color: var(--border);

        }

        .checklist-item.checked {

            background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.08);

            border-color: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.2);

        }

        .check-box {

            width: 22px;

            height: 22px;

            border-radius: 6px;

            border: 2px solid var(--border);

            flex-shrink: 0;

            display: flex;

            align-items: center;

            justify-content: center;

            transition: var(--transition);

            font-size: 0.7rem;

            background: var(--surface-3);

        }

        .checklist-item.checked .check-box {

            background: var(--green);

            border-color: var(--green);

            color: #0a0a18;

        }

        .checklist-label {

            font-size: 0.83rem;

            color: var(--text);

            transition: var(--transition);

        }

        .checklist-item.checked .checklist-label {

            color: #c8e6c9;

        }



        /* ── HANDOFF OUTPUT ─────────────── */

        .handoff-output {

            background: #0a0a16;

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            border-radius: var(--radius);

            padding: 1rem 1.2rem;

            font-family: var(--font-mono);

            font-size: 0.78rem;

            color: #c0c0d0;

            white-space: pre-wrap;

            max-height: 420px;

            overflow-y: auto;

            line-height: 1.6;

            min-height: 80px;

            letter-spacing: 0.01em;

            tab-size: 2;

        }

        .handoff-output:empty::after {

            content: 'Your compiled handoff will appear here...';

            color: var(--text-muted);

            font-style: italic;

        }



        /* ── TOAST ──────────────────────── */

        .toast {

            position: fixed;

            bottom: 2rem;

            left: 50%;

            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(120px);

            background: #2e2e48;

            color: #fff;

            padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;

            border-radius: 30px;

            font-weight: 600;

            font-size: 0.85rem;

            z-index: 999;

            pointer-events: none;

            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1);

            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

        }

        .toast.show {

            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);

        }

        .toast.success {

            background: #1b3a2d;

            border-color: #4caf50;

            color: #a5d6a7;

        }



        /* ── SCROLLBAR ──────────────────── */

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {

            width: 6px;

            height: 6px;

        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {

            background: transparent;

        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {

            background: #3a3a55;

            border-radius: 10px;

        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {

            background: #4a4a65;

        }



        /* ── MISC ───────────────────────── */

        .divider {

            border: none;

            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);

            margin: 0.3rem 0;

        }

        .overall-badge {

            display: inline-flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 0.4rem;

            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;

            border-radius: 20px;

            font-weight: 700;

            font-size: 0.9rem;

            background: var(--surface-3);

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

        }

        .overall-badge.good {

            border-color: #4caf50;

            color: #a5d6a7;

            background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.1);

        }

        .overall-badge.okay {

            border-color: #ff9800;

            color: #ffcc80;

            background: rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.1);

        }

        .overall-badge.poor {

            border-color: #ef5350;

            color: #ef9a9a;

            background: rgba(239, 83, 80, 0.1);

        }

        .brief-fields-container {

            display: flex;

            flex-direction: column;

            gap: 0.6rem;

        }

    </style>

</head>

<body>



    <!-- ═══════════ HEADER ═══════════ -->

    <header class="header">

        <div class="header-brand">

            <div class="icon">🔍</div>

            <span>Fidelity Review Board</span>

        </div>

        <div class="header-actions">

            <span class="save-indicator" id="saveIndicator">

                <span class="save-dot"></span>

                <span id="saveText">Ready</span>

            </span>

            <button class="btn ghost" onclick="generateHandoff()" title="Generate handoff preview">📋 Preview</button>

            <button class="btn primary" onclick="copyHandoff()" title="Copy full handoff to clipboard">📤 Copy Handoff</button>

            <button class="btn danger-ghost" onclick="resetAll()" title="Clear all data">🗑 Reset</button>

        </div>

    </header>



    <!-- ═══════════ MAIN CONTENT ═══════════ -->

    <div class="main-container" id="mainContainer">



        <!-- LEFT PANEL -->

        <div class="panel" id="leftPanel">

            <!-- Reference Photo / Prompt -->

            <div class="card" id="cardReference">

                <div class="card-header">

                    <span class="dot accent"></span> Reference Photo / Prompt

                </div>

                <label for="refPrompt">Paste your reference photo description or prompt here</label>

                <textarea class="tall" id="refPrompt" placeholder="Paste or type the reference photo prompt / description here…&#10;&#10;e.g. 'A woman with auburn hair in a red dress, standing by a sunlit window, soft golden hour light, bookshelf background, shallow depth of field…'"></textarea>

            </div>



            <!-- Brief Fields -->

            <div class="card" id="cardBriefs">

                <div class="card-header">

                    <span class="dot purple"></span> Brief Fields

                </div>

                <label>Pasteable brief fields for quick reference notes</label>

                <div class="brief-fields-container" id="briefFieldsContainer">

                    <input type="text" class="brief-field" placeholder="Brief field #1 — e.g. character name, scene code…" data-brief-index="0">

                    <input type="text" class="brief-field" placeholder="Brief field #2" data-brief-index="1">

                    <input type="text" class="brief-field" placeholder="Brief field #3" data-brief-index="2">

                </div>

                <button class="btn ghost" style="margin-top:0.5rem;font-size:0.75rem;" onclick="addBriefField()" title="Add another brief field">＋ Add Brief Field</button>

            </div>



            <!-- Before / After Constraint Notes -->

            <div class="card" id="cardConstraints">

                <div class="card-header">

                    <span class="dot pink"></span> Before / After Constraint Notes

                </div>

                <div class="constraint-grid">

                    <div>

                        <label for="beforeNotes">📌 BEFORE — Constraints identified pre-generation</label>

                        <textarea class="short" id="beforeNotes" placeholder="e.g. Must keep hair color exact, no changes to jewelry, keep background blur consistent…"></textarea>

                    </div>

                    <div>

                        <label for="afterNotes">🔍 AFTER — What actually happened / drift observed</label>

                        <textarea class="short" id="afterNotes" placeholder="e.g. Hair shifted slightly warmer, necklace changed, background elements drifted…"></textarea>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>



        <!-- RIGHT PANEL -->

        <div class="panel" id="rightPanel">

            <!-- Score Tiles -->

            <div class="card" id="cardScores">

                <div class="card-header">

                    <span class="dot accent"></span> Fidelity Score Tiles

                </div>

                <div class="score-tiles" id="scoreTilesContainer">

                    <!-- Generated by JS -->

                </div>

                <div style="margin-top:0.8rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">

                    <span style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-muted);">Overall:</span>

                    <span class="overall-badge" id="overallBadge">— / 25</span>

                </div>

            </div>



            <!-- No-Drift Constraints (extra detail) -->

            <div class="card" id="cardNoDrift">

                <div class="card-header">

                    <span class="dot purple"></span> No-Drift Anchor Locks

                </div>

                <label>Elements that MUST NOT change across iterations</label>

                <textarea class="short" id="noDriftNotes" placeholder="e.g. Face shape locked, eye color locked, specific prop must remain identical, tattoo on left arm must stay…"></textarea>

                <div style="margin-top:0.6rem;display:flex;gap:0.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;" id="driftTagContainer">

                    <!-- drift lock tags generated by JS -->

                </div>

                <button class="btn ghost" style="margin-top:0.5rem;font-size:0.75rem;" onclick="addDriftTag()">＋ Pin a Drift Lock</button>

            </div>

        </div>



        <!-- BOTTOM FULL-WIDTH -->

        <div class="panel" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;" id="bottomPanel">

            <!-- Checklist Toggles -->

            <div class="card" id="cardChecklist">

                <div class="card-header">

                    <span class="dot accent"></span> Fidelity Checklist

                </div>

                <div class="checklist" id="checklistContainer">

                    <!-- Generated by JS -->

                </div>

            </div>



            <!-- Handoff Output Preview -->

            <div class="card" id="cardHandoff">

                <div class="card-header">

                    <span class="dot purple"></span> Copyable Handoff Summary

                </div>

                <div class="handoff-output" id="handoffOutput"></div>

                <div style="margin-top:0.8rem;display:flex;gap:0.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">

                    <button class="btn primary" onclick="copyHandoff()">📤 Copy to Clipboard</button>

                    <button class="btn ghost" onclick="generateHandoff()">🔄 Refresh Preview</button>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>



    <!-- TOAST -->

    <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>



    <script>

        (function() {

            // ─── STATE ──────────────────────────

            const DEFAULT_CHECKLIST = [

                { id: 'face_match', label: 'Face matches reference', checked: false },

                { id: 'body_proportions', label: 'Body proportions correct', checked: false },

                { id: 'lighting_direction', label: 'Lighting direction matches', checked: false },

                { id: 'color_temp', label: 'Color temperature accurate', checked: false },

                { id: 'bg_elements', label: 'Background elements present', checked: false },

                { id: 'no_artifacts', label: 'No unwanted artifacts', checked: false },

                { id: 'clothing_match', label: 'Clothing / outfit matches', checked: false },

                { id: 'expression_match', label: 'Expression matches reference', checked: false },

                { id: 'camera_angle', label: 'Camera angle matches', checked: false },

                { id: 'dof_match', label: 'Depth of field matches', checked: false },

                { id: 'hair_match', label: 'Hair style & color match', checked: false },

                { id: 'skin_tone', label: 'Skin tone consistent', checked: false },

            ];



            const SCORE_CATEGORIES = [

                { key: 'identity', label: 'Identity', sub: 'Face, features, character recognition', icon: '👤' },

                { key: 'pose', label: 'Pose', sub: 'Body position, gesture, angle', icon: '🧍' },

                { key: 'lighting', label: 'Lighting', sub: 'Direction, quality, color of light', icon: '💡' },

                { key: 'background', label: 'Background', sub: 'Setting, environment, props', icon: '🖼' },

                { key: 'nodrift', label: 'No-Drift', sub: 'Consistency, locked elements preserved', icon: '🔒' },

            ];



            let state = {

                refPrompt: '',

                briefFields: ['', '', ''],

                beforeNotes: '',

                afterNotes: '',

                noDriftNotes: '',

                driftTags: [],

                scores: {

                    identity: 0,

                    pose: 0,

                    lighting: 0,

                    background: 0,

                    nodrift: 0,

                },

                checklist: JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(DEFAULT_CHECKLIST)),

            };



            // ─── DOM REFS ──────────────────────

            const $refPrompt = document.getElementById('refPrompt');

            const $beforeNotes = document.getElementById('beforeNotes');

            const $afterNotes = document.getElementById('afterNotes');

            const $noDriftNotes = document.getElementById('noDriftNotes');

            const $briefFieldsContainer = document.getElementById('briefFieldsContainer');

            const $scoreTilesContainer = document.getElementById('scoreTilesContainer');

            const $checklistContainer = document.getElementById('checklistContainer');

            const $handoffOutput = document.getElementById('handoffOutput');

            const $overallBadge = document.getElementById('overallBadge');

            const $saveIndicator = document.getElementById('saveIndicator');

            const $saveText = document.getElementById('saveText');

            const $toast = document.getElementById('toast');

            const $driftTagContainer = document.getElementById('driftTagContainer');



            // ─── LOAD STATE ────────────────────

            function loadState() {

                try {

                    const raw = localStorage.getItem('fidelity-review-board-state');

                    if (raw) {

                        const parsed = JSON.parse(raw);

                        // Merge carefully to handle schema changes

                        state.refPrompt = parsed.refPrompt || '';

                        state.briefFields = Array.isArray(parsed.briefFields) ? parsed.briefFields : ['', '', ''];

                        state.beforeNotes = parsed.beforeNotes || '';

                        state.afterNotes = parsed.afterNotes || '';

                        state.noDriftNotes = parsed.noDriftNotes || '';

                        state.driftTags = Array.isArray(parsed.driftTags) ? parsed.driftTags : [];

                        if (parsed.scores && typeof parsed.scores === 'object') {

                            for (const cat of SCORE_CATEGORIES) {

                                state.scores[cat.key] = typeof parsed.scores[cat.key] === 'number' ?

                                    Math.max(0, Math.min(5, parsed.scores[cat.key])) : 0;

                            }

                        }

                        if (Array.isArray(parsed.checklist)) {

                            // Merge with defaults to handle new items

                            const savedMap = {};

                            parsed.checklist.forEach(item => { savedMap[item.id] = item.checked; });

                            state.checklist = DEFAULT_CHECKLIST.map(item => ({

                                ...item,

                                checked: savedMap[item.id] === true,

                            }));

                        }

                    }

                } catch (e) {

                    console.warn('Failed to load state from localStorage:', e);

                }

            }



            function saveState() {

                try {

                    const toSave = {

                        refPrompt: state.refPrompt,

                        briefFields: state.briefFields,

                        beforeNotes: state.beforeNotes,

                        afterNotes: state.afterNotes,

                        noDriftNotes: state.noDriftNotes,

                        driftTags: state.driftTags,

                        scores: state.scores,

                        checklist: state.checklist,

                        savedAt: new Date().toISOString(),

                    };

                    localStorage.setItem('fidelity-review-board-state', JSON.stringify(toSave));

                    showSaveIndicator(true);

                    return true;

                } catch (e) {

                    console.warn('Failed to save state:', e);

                    showSaveIndicator(false);

                    return false;

                }

            }



            function showSaveIndicator(saved) {

                if (saved) {

                    $saveIndicator.classList.add('saved');

                    $saveText.textContent = 'Saved';

                    setTimeout(() => {

                        $saveIndicator.classList.remove('saved');

                        $saveText.textContent = 'Ready';

                    }, 1800);

                } else {

                    $saveIndicator.classList.remove('saved');

                    $saveText.textContent = 'Storage full';

                }

            }



            // ─── BUILD UI ──────────────────────

            function buildScoreTiles() {

                $scoreTilesContainer.innerHTML = '';

                SCORE_CATEGORIES.forEach(cat => {

                    const score = state.scores[cat.key] || 0;

                    const tile = document.createElement('div');

                    tile.className = `score-tile score-${score}`;

                    tile.innerHTML = `

                <div class="score-tile-info">

                  <div class="score-tile-label">${cat.icon} ${cat.label}</div>

                  <div class="score-tile-sub">${cat.sub}</div>

                </div>

                <div class="score-dots" data-category="${cat.key}">

                  ${[1,2,3,4,5].map(n => {

                    const active = n <= score;

                    return `<div class="score-dot ${active ? 'active lvl-'+n : ''}" data-value="${n}" title="Score ${n}/5"></div>`;

                  }).join('')}

                </div>

                <div class="score-value-badge">${score > 0 ? score + '/5' : '—'}</div>

              `;

                    $scoreTilesContainer.appendChild(tile);

                });



                // Attach click handlers to all dots

                $scoreTilesContainer.querySelectorAll('.score-dot').forEach(dot => {

                    dot.addEventListener('click', function(e) {

                        e.stopPropagation();

                        const value = parseInt(this.getAttribute('data-value'));

                        const category = this.closest('.score-dots').getAttribute('data-category');

                        if (category && value >= 1 && value <= 5) {

                            // Toggle: if clicking the same value that's already set, set to 0

                            if (state.scores[category] === value) {

                                state.scores[category] = 0;

                            } else {

                                state.scores[category] = value;

                            }

                            buildScoreTiles();

                            updateOverallBadge();

                            saveState();

                            generateHandoff();

                        }

                    });

                });

            }



            function buildChecklist() {

                $checklistContainer.innerHTML = '';

                state.checklist.forEach((item, index) => {

                    const div = document.createElement('div');

                    div.className = `checklist-item ${item.checked ? 'checked' : ''}`;

                    div.innerHTML = `

                <div class="check-box">${item.checked ? '✓' : ''}</div>

                <span class="checklist-label">${item.label}</span>

              `;

                    div.addEventListener('click', () => {

                        state.checklist[index].checked = !state.checklist[index].checked;

                        buildChecklist();

                        saveState();

                        generateHandoff();

                    });

                    $checklistContainer.appendChild(div);

                });

            }



            function buildBriefFields() {

                $briefFieldsContainer.innerHTML = '';

                state.briefFields.forEach((val, i) => {

                    const input = document.createElement('input');

                    input.type = 'text';

                    input.className = 'brief-field';

                    input.value = val;

                    input.placeholder = `Brief field #${i + 1}`;

                    input.setAttribute('data-brief-index', i);

                    input.addEventListener('input', function() {

                        const idx = parseInt(this.getAttribute('data-brief-index'));

                        if (!isNaN(idx) && idx >= 0 && idx < state.briefFields.length) {

                            state.briefFields[idx] = this.value;

                            saveState();

                            generateHandoff();

                        }

                    });

                    // Add remove button for extra fields (beyond first 3)

                    if (i >= 3) {

                        const wrapper = document.createElement('div');

                        wrapper.style.display = 'flex';

                        wrapper.style.gap = '0.4rem';

                        wrapper.style.alignItems = 'center';

                        input.style.flex = '1';

                        const removeBtn = document.createElement('button');

                        removeBtn.className = 'btn danger-ghost';

                        removeBtn.textContent = '✕';

                        removeBtn.style.padding = '0.25rem 0.5rem';

                        removeBtn.style.fontSize = '0.7rem';

                        removeBtn.title = 'Remove this brief field';

                        removeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {

                            state.briefFields.splice(i, 1);

                            buildBriefFields();

                            saveState();

                            generateHandoff();

                        });

                        wrapper.appendChild(input);

                        wrapper.appendChild(removeBtn);

                        $briefFieldsContainer.appendChild(wrapper);

                    } else {

                        $briefFieldsContainer.appendChild(input);

                    }

                });

            }



            function buildDriftTags() {

                $driftTagContainer.innerHTML = '';

                state.driftTags.forEach((tag, i) => {

                    const tagEl = document.createElement('span');

                    tagEl.style.cssText = `

                display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.35rem;

                padding:0.35rem 0.7rem;border-radius:20px;

                background:rgba(139,92,246,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.3);

                font-size:0.78rem;color:#d1c4e9;font-weight:500;

              `;

                    tagEl.innerHTML = `🔒 ${escapeHTML(tag)} <span style="cursor:pointer;opacity:0.6;font-weight:700;" data-remove-drift="${i}">✕</span>`;

                    $driftTagContainer.appendChild(tagEl);

                });

                // Attach remove handlers

                $driftTagContainer.querySelectorAll('[data-remove-drift]').forEach(span => {

                    span.addEventListener('click', function(e) {

                        e.stopPropagation();

                        const idx = parseInt(this.getAttribute('data-remove-drift'));

                        if (!isNaN(idx) && idx >= 0 && idx < state.driftTags.length) {

                            state.driftTags.splice(idx, 1);

                            buildDriftTags();

                            saveState();

                            generateHandoff();

                        }

                    });

                });

            }



            function updateOverallBadge() {

                let total = 0;

                SCORE_CATEGORIES.forEach(cat => { total += state.scores[cat.key] || 0; });

                const max = SCORE_CATEGORIES.length * 5;

                const pct = max > 0 ? Math.round((total / max) * 100) : 0;

                $overallBadge.textContent = `${total} / ${max}  (${pct}%)`;

                $overallBadge.classList.remove('good', 'okay', 'poor');

                if (pct >= 70) $overallBadge.classList.add('good');

                else if (pct >= 40) $overallBadge.classList.add('okay');

                else if (total > 0) $overallBadge.classList.add('poor');

            }



            function escapeHTML(str) {

                const div = document.createElement('div');

                div.textContent = str;

                return div.innerHTML;

            }



            // ─── HANGOFF GENERATION ────────────

            function generateHandoff() {

                const lines = [];

                lines.push('═══════════════════════════════════');

                lines.push('  REFERENCE FIDELITY REVIEW HANDOFF');

                lines.push('═══════════════════════════════════');

                lines.push('');

                lines.push(`📅 Date: ${new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { weekday: 'short', year: 'numeric', month: 'short', day: 'numeric' })}`);

                lines.push(`🕐 Time: ${new Date().toLocaleTimeString('en-US', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' })}`);

                lines.push('');



                if (state.refPrompt.trim()) {

                    lines.push('─── REFERENCE PROMPT ───');

                    lines.push(state.refPrompt.trim());

                    lines.push('');

                }



                // Brief fields

                const filledBriefs = state.briefFields.filter(f => f.trim());

                if (filledBriefs.length > 0) {

                    lines.push('─── BRIEF FIELDS ───');

                    filledBriefs.forEach((f, i) => {

                        lines.push(`  [${i + 1}] ${f.trim()}`);

                    });

                    lines.push('');

                }



                // Scores

                lines.push('─── FIDELITY SCORES ───');

                let totalScore = 0;

                const maxScore = SCORE_CATEGORIES.length * 5;

                SCORE_CATEGORIES.forEach(cat => {

                    const s = state.scores[cat.key] || 0;

                    totalScore += s;

                    const bar = '█'.repeat(s) + '░'.repeat(5 - s);

                    lines.push(`  ${cat.icon} ${cat.label.padEnd(14)} [${bar}]  ${s}/5`);

                });

                const pct = maxScore > 0 ? Math.round((totalScore / maxScore) * 100) : 0;

                lines.push(`  ═══════════════════════════`);

                lines.push(`  OVERALL: ${totalScore}/${maxScore}  (${pct}%)  ${pct >= 70 ? '✅' : pct >= 40 ? '⚠️' : '❌'}`);

                lines.push('');



                // No-Drift

                if (state.noDriftNotes.trim() || state.driftTags.length > 0) {

                    lines.push('─── NO-DRIFT ANCHOR LOCKS ───');

                    if (state.noDriftNotes.trim()) {

                        lines.push(`  Notes: ${state.noDriftNotes.trim()}`);

                    }

                    if (state.driftTags.length > 0) {

                        lines.push('  Pinned Locks:');

                        state.driftTags.forEach(tag => { lines.push(`    🔒 ${tag}`); });

                    }

                    lines.push('');

                }



                // Before/After

                if (state.beforeNotes.trim() || state.afterNotes.trim()) {

                    lines.push('─── CONSTRAINT NOTES ───');

                    if (state.beforeNotes.trim()) {

                        lines.push(`  📌 BEFORE: ${state.beforeNotes.trim()}`);

                    }

                    if (state.afterNotes.trim()) {

                        lines.push(`  🔍 AFTER:  ${state.afterNotes.trim()}`);

                    }

                    lines.push('');

                }



                // Checklist

                lines.push('─── FIDELITY CHECKLIST ───');

                state.checklist.forEach(item => {

                    const icon = item.checked ? '✅' : '⬜';

                    lines.push(`  ${icon}  ${item.label}`);

                });

                const checkedCount = state.checklist.filter(i => i.checked).length;

                const totalItems = state.checklist.length;

                lines.push(`  ─────────────────────────`);

                lines.push(`  ${checkedCount}/${totalItems} items passed`);

                lines.push('');



                lines.push('═══════════════════════════════════');

                lines.push('  END OF HANDOFF');

                lines.push('═══════════════════════════════════');



                const output = lines.join('\n');

                $handoffOutput.textContent = output;

                return output;

            }



            async function copyHandoff() {

                const text = generateHandoff();

                try {

                    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);

                    showToast('✅ Handoff copied to clipboard!', 'success');

                } catch (err) {

                    // Fallback for older browsers

                    const ta = document.createElement('textarea');

                    ta.value = text;

                    ta.style.position = 'fixed';

                    ta.style.opacity = '0';

                    document.body.appendChild(ta);

                    ta.select();

                    try {

                        document.execCommand('copy');

                        showToast('✅ Handoff copied!', 'success');

                    } catch (e) {

                        showToast('⚠️ Failed to copy. Please select the text manually.', '');

                    }

                    document.body.removeChild(ta);

                }

            }



            // ─── TOAST ─────────────────────────

            let toastTimeout;



            function showToast(msg, type) {

                clearTimeout(toastTimeout);

                $toast.textContent = msg;

                $toast.className = 'toast ' + (type || '');

                requestAnimationFrame(() => {

                    $toast.classList.add('show');

                });

                toastTimeout = setTimeout(() => {

                    $toast.classList.remove('show');

                }, 2200);

            }



            // ─── ACTIONS ───────────────────────

            function addBriefField() {

                state.briefFields.push('');

                buildBriefFields();

                saveState();

                generateHandoff();

                // Focus the new field

                const allFields = $briefFieldsContainer.querySelectorAll('input.brief-field');

                if (allFields.length > 0) {

                    const lastField = allFields[allFields.length - 1];

                    lastField.focus();

                }

            }



            function addDriftTag() {

                const tag = prompt('Enter a drift-lock tag (e.g. "Face shape", "Eye color", "Tattoo placement"):');

                if (tag && tag.trim()) {

                    state.driftTags.push(tag.trim());

                    buildDriftTags();

                    saveState();

                    generateHandoff();

                }

            }



            function resetAll() {

                if (confirm(

                        'Are you sure you want to reset ALL data?\n\nThis will clear all scores, notes, checklist items, and brief fields. This cannot be undone.'

                        )) {

                    state = {

                        refPrompt: '',

                        briefFields: ['', '', ''],

                        beforeNotes: '',

                        afterNotes: '',

                        noDriftNotes: '',

                        driftTags: [],

                        scores: {

                            identity: 0,

                            pose: 0,

                            lighting: 0,

                            background: 0,

                            nodrift: 0,

                        },

                        checklist: JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(DEFAULT_CHECKLIST)),

                    };

                    syncAllUI();

                    saveState();

                    generateHandoff();

                    showToast('🔄 All data has been reset.', '');

                }

            }



            function syncAllUI() {

                $refPrompt.value = state.refPrompt;

                $beforeNotes.value = state.beforeNotes;

                $afterNotes.value = state.afterNotes;

                $noDriftNotes.value = state.noDriftNotes;

                buildBriefFields();

                buildScoreTiles();

                buildChecklist();

                buildDriftTags();

                updateOverallBadge();

                generateHandoff();

            }



            // ─── EVENT LISTENERS ───────────────

            $refPrompt.addEventListener('input', function() {

                state.refPrompt = this.value;

                saveState();

                generateHandoff();

            });

            $beforeNotes.addEventListener('input', function() {

                state.beforeNotes = this.value;

                saveState();

                generateHandoff();

            });

            $afterNotes.addEventListener('input', function() {

                state.afterNotes = this.value;

                saveState();

                generateHandoff();

            });

            $noDriftNotes.addEventListener('input', function() {

                state.noDriftNotes = this.value;

                saveState();

                generateHandoff();

            });



            // Keyboard shortcut: Ctrl+Shift+C to copy handoff

            document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {

                if (e.ctrlKey && e.shiftKey && e.key === 'C') {

                    e.preventDefault();

                    copyHandoff();

                }

            });



            // Auto-save on beforeunload

            window.addEventListener('beforeunload', () => {

                saveState();

            });



            // ─── EXPOSE TO GLOBAL ─────────────

            window.generateHandoff = generateHandoff;

            window.copyHandoff = copyHandoff;

            window.addBriefField = addBriefField;

            window.addDriftTag = addDriftTag;

            window.resetAll = resetAll;



            // ─── INIT ──────────────────────────

            function init() {

                loadState();

                syncAllUI();

                // Initial save to ensure localStorage is populated

                saveState();

                console.log('✅ Fidelity Review Board initialized.');

                console.log('   💡 Tip: Press Ctrl+Shift+C to quickly copy the handoff.');

            }



            init();

        })();

    </script>

</body>

</html>
Review Board

Here’s how the tool helps you run structured fidelity audits and export clean reference reports:

Pasteable Brief Fields & Reference Prompt: The left panel houses a large text area for your main reference prompt, plus dynamic "brief fields" you can add or remove. These are perfect for pasting character names, scene codes, or quick contextual notes.

Interactive Score Tiles: On the right side, you'll find five clickable tiles for Identity, Pose, Lighting, Background, and No-Drift. Simply click the dots to rate each category from 1 to 5. The tiles change color and a live "Overall" badge shows your total score out of 25.

Constraint Notes & Drift Locks: Use the "Before/After" text areas to log what you expected versus what actually changed. The dedicated "No-Drift Anchor Locks" section lets you pin specific elements (like "eye color" or "tattoo placement") as tags, ensuring they remain top-of-mind.

Checklist Toggles & Copyable Handoff: The bottom section contains a fidelity checklist with toggle switches for common checks. Once your review is complete, click "Copy Handoff" to generate a formatted text report containing all scores, notes, and checklist status, ready to paste into a prompt or share with a team.

